## GET /api/market/fda-calendar

FDA Calendar

Returns FDA calendar data with filtering options.

The FDA calendar contains information about:
- PDUFA (Prescription Drug User Fee Act) dates
- Advisory Committee Meetings
- FDA Decisions
- Clinical Trial Results
- New Drug Applications
- Biologics License Applications

## Date Format Support
The target_date parameters support various FDA-specific date formats:
- Quarters: YYYY-Q[1-4] (e.g. 2024-Q1)
- Half years: YYYY-H[1-2] (e.g. 2024-H1)
- Mid-year: YYYY-MID (e.g. 2024-MID)
- Late-year: YYYY-LATE (e.g. 2024-LATE)
- Standard dates: YYYY-MM-DD


### Fully resolved operation
```json
{
  "key": "GET /api/market/fda-calendar",
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/market/fda-calendar",
  "transport": "http-rest",
  "operation": {
    "callbacks": {},
    "description": "Returns FDA calendar data with filtering options.\n\nThe FDA calendar contains information about:\n- PDUFA (Prescription Drug User Fee Act) dates\n- Advisory Committee Meetings\n- FDA Decisions\n- Clinical Trial Results\n- New Drug Applications\n- Biologics License Applications\n\n## Date Format Support\nThe target_date parameters support various FDA-specific date formats:\n- Quarters: YYYY-Q[1-4] (e.g. 2024-Q1)\n- Half years: YYYY-H[1-2] (e.g. 2024-H1)\n- Mid-year: YYYY-MID (e.g. 2024-MID)\n- Late-year: YYYY-LATE (e.g. 2024-LATE)\n- Standard dates: YYYY-MM-DD\n",
    "operationId": "PublicApi.MarketController.fda_calendar",
    "parameters": [
      {
        "description": "Minimum announced date (YYYY-MM-DD)",
        "in": "query",
        "name": "announced_date_min",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "description": "A trading date in the format of YYYY-MM-DD.\nThis is optional and by default the last trading date.\n",
          "example": "2024-01-18",
          "title": "Optional Market Date",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      {
        "description": "Maximum announced date (YYYY-MM-DD)",
        "in": "query",
        "name": "announced_date_max",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "description": "A trading date in the format of YYYY-MM-DD.\nThis is optional and by default the last trading date.\n",
          "example": "2024-01-18",
          "title": "Optional Market Date",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      {
        "description": "Minimum target date (supports Q1-Q4, H1-H2, MID, LATE formats)",
        "in": "query",
        "name": "target_date_min",
        "required": false,
        "schema": {
          "description": "FDA target date in one of the following formats:\n- YYYY-Q[1-4] (e.g. 2024-Q1)\n- YYYY-H[1-2] (e.g. 2024-H1)\n- YYYY-MID (e.g. 2024-MID)\n- YYYY-LATE (e.g. 2024-LATE)\n- YYYY-MM-DD\n",
          "example": "2024-Q1",
          "pattern": "^\\d{4}-(Q[1-4]|H[1-2]|MID|LATE|\\d{2}-\\d{2})$",
          "title": "FDA Target Date",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      {
        "description": "Maximum target date (supports Q1-Q4, H1-H2, MID, LATE formats)",
        "in": "query",
        "name": "target_date_max",
        "required": false,
